<p dir="auto">Chrome 146 adds support for scroll-triggered animations; see <a href="https://chromestatus.com/feature/5181996801982464" rel="nofollow">https://chromestatus.com/feature/5181996801982464</a>.</p>
<p dir="auto">The <a href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29033" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29033/hovercard">latest Chrome collector PR</a> has added BCD for several of the related features; my PR adds a few more, namely the <code class="notranslate">&lt;animation-action&gt;</code> data type, and the related range properties, which <em>are</em> supported but currently under an old name.</p>
